### Access Exception

**PhD P1 affiliates and above can skip this section.** If you are a P1 member currently enrolled
in an MSc, research assistant (RA) role, or similar, you are not eligible for access without a
written approval of exception from a responsible person (a P1 co-lead or faculty member) who can
vouch for your request. Fill in the form below and have the responsible person send a confirmation
to [compute-governance-p1@aicentre.dk](mailto:compute-governance-p1@aicentre.dk) so they can audit
the request.

